/farmland-atlas/minnesota/goodhue-county"],["ARC or PLC in Goodhue County","/arc-plc/minnesota/goodhue-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids in Goodhue County came in under 90% of normal in September to October and November to December in 37 of 75 years on record from 1951 to 2025. On the middle, January to February ran 26% of normal in 2025, and March to April ran 149% in 2025. So far in 2026 the middle shows May to June at 56% of normal.</p>"}
